#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:11
msgid "7 · Check the fit and compare models"
msgstr "7 · Memeriksa kecocokan dan membandingkan model"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:13
msgid "Check that a model reproduces the data, then rank the candidate models."
msgstr "Periksa bahwa model dapat mereproduksi data, lalu urutkan model-model kandidat."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:15
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You need models that passed {doc}`05-check-convergence`. Compared models must be fitted to the same response and the same rows; otherwise `compare_models()` raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "Anda membutuhkan model yang lolos {doc}`05-check-convergence`. Model yang dibandingkan harus di-fit pada respons dan baris yang sama; jika tidak, `compare_models()` memunculkan `ValueError`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:34
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Kerjakan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:36
msgid "Posterior predictive check"
msgstr "Posterior predictive check"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:43
msgid "The plot shows data replicated from the posterior next to the observed data. It is drawn for one model: the model passed, or the first model of a list. `n_draws_ppc=` sets the number of replicated datasets (default 100)."
msgstr "Plot menampilkan data replikasi dari posterior di samping data amatan. Plot digambar untuk satu model: model yang diberikan, atau model pertama dalam list. `n_draws_ppc=` menentukan jumlah dataset replikasi (bawaan 100)."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:47
msgid "Compare models"
msgstr "Membandingkan model"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:57
msgid "The R-style alias `hbmc` is the same function."
msgstr "Alias gaya R `hbmc` adalah fungsi yang sama."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:59
msgid "`cmp.loo`, `cmp.bayes_factor` and `cmp.prior_sensitivity` follow the shape of the input:"
msgstr "`cmp.loo`, `cmp.bayes_factor`, dan `cmp.prior_sensitivity` mengikuti bentuk input:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "Call"
msgstr "Pemanggilan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Mengembalikan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "`compare_models(model)`"
msgstr "`compare_models(model)`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "a single result"
msgstr "satu hasil"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "`compare_models([model])`"
msgstr "`compare_models([model])`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "a dict with the key `\"model_0\"`"
msgstr "dict dengan kunci `\"model_0\"`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "`compare_models([m1, m2])`"
msgstr "`compare_models([m1, m2])`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md
msgid "a dict with one entry per model"
msgstr "dict dengan satu entri per model"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:67
msgid "Test the coefficients"
msgstr "Menguji koefisien"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:69
msgid "`metrics=[\"loo\", \"bf\"]` adds a Bayes factor for each coefficient:"
msgstr "`metrics=[\"loo\", \"bf\"]` menambahkan faktor Bayes untuk setiap koefisien:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:78
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:80
msgid "**Posterior predictive check.** The model is adequate when the observed data lies within the replicated data. A systematic gap, such as a shifted centre, a wrong spread or a missing tail, means the model does not reproduce the data."
msgstr "**Posterior predictive check.** Model memadai jika data amatan berada di dalam data replikasi. Selisih yang sistematis, misalnya pusat yang bergeser, sebaran yang keliru, atau ekor yang hilang, berarti model tidak mereproduksi data."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:84
msgid "**ELPD** (PSIS-LOO-CV). Higher is better. When the difference between two models (`elpd_diff`) is smaller than about twice its standard error (`dse`), the data cannot tell them apart."
msgstr "**ELPD** (PSIS-LOO-CV). Makin tinggi makin baik. Jika selisih dua model (`elpd_diff`) lebih kecil dari kira-kira dua kali galat bakunya (`dse`), data tidak dapat membedakan keduanya."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:88
msgid "**Pareto k.** Observations with *k* above about 0.7 make the LOO estimate unreliable. Fay-Herriot models often have some, because every area has one observation and its own random effect. When many are flagged, treat the ranking as indicative only."
msgstr "**Pareto k.** Observasi dengan *k* di atas sekitar 0.7 membuat estimasi LOO tidak dapat diandalkan. Model Fay-Herriot sering memilikinya, karena setiap area memiliki satu observasi dan efek acaknya sendiri. Jika banyak observasi ditandai, anggap peringkat hanya sebagai indikasi."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:92
msgid "**Bayes factor.** `BF10` is the evidence that a coefficient differs from zero (Savage-Dickey). It tests one coefficient within one model, unlike R's `hbmc()`, which compares whole models by bridge sampling. A vague prior on the coefficient inflates the evidence for zero."
msgstr "**Faktor Bayes.** `BF10` adalah bukti bahwa sebuah koefisien berbeda dari nol (Savage-Dickey). Ini menguji satu koefisien di dalam satu model, berbeda dengan `hbmc()` di R yang membandingkan model utuh dengan bridge sampling. Prior yang samar pada koefisien membesar-besarkan bukti untuk nol."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Adequate:** continue to {doc}`08-prior-sensitivity`."
msgstr "**Memadai:** lanjutkan ke {doc}`08-prior-sensitivity`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:97
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Not adequate:** go back to {doc}`02-specify-model` and change the family, the auxiliary variables or the link."
msgstr "**Tidak memadai:** kembali ke {doc}`02-specify-model` dan ubah family, variabel penyerta, atau link."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:100
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jika gagal"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:102
msgid "**WAIC is requested.** It is not available; use LOO."
msgstr "**WAIC diminta.** WAIC tidak tersedia; gunakan LOO."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:111
msgid "**`ValueError` before anything is computed.** The list of models is empty, `metrics` is empty, `n_draws_ppc` is not a positive integer, or the models were fitted to different data."
msgstr "**`ValueError` sebelum apa pun dihitung.** List model kosong, `metrics` kosong, `n_draws_ppc` bukan bilangan bulat positif, atau model-model di-fit pada data yang berbeda."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:114
msgid "**`ModelNotFittedError`.** Fit every model first."
msgstr "**`ModelNotFittedError`.** Lakukan fitting setiap model terlebih dahulu."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:116
msgid "**The log-likelihood group is missing.** LOO needs the log-likelihood that `fit()` computes. A model fitted by other means raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "**Grup log-likelihood tidak ada.** LOO membutuhkan log-likelihood yang dihitung `fit()`. Model yang di-fit dengan cara lain memunculkan `ValueError`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:119
msgid "**A plot is missing.** The reason is stored in `cmp.plot_errors`. The table is still returned."
msgstr "**Plot tidak muncul.** Alasannya disimpan di `cmp.plot_errors`. Tabelnya tetap dikembalikan."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:122
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/07-check-fit-and-compare.md:124
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Why comparison comes after convergence and before estimation: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."
msgstr "Mengapa perbandingan dilakukan setelah konvergensi dan sebelum estimasi: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."

